WEBVTT

00:00.940 --> 00:07.612
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.940 --> 00:07.612
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.676 --> 00:14.703
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.676 --> 00:14.703
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.288 --> 00:21.960
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.288 --> 00:21.960
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.985 --> 00:28.199
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.985 --> 00:28.199
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.093 --> 00:34.765
This surging power...

00:29.093 --> 00:34.765
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.093 --> 00:31.180
Black Jack

00:36.267 --> 00:42.522
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.267 --> 00:42.522
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.316 --> 00:48.278
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.316 --> 00:48.278
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.849 --> 00:57.204
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.849 --> 00:57.204
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.705 --> 00:59.396
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.396 --> 01:01.389
will be there

01:01.409 --> 01:04.369
It makes me glad...

01:01.409 --> 01:04.369
yokatta

01:04.614 --> 01:12.094
That I found my place here.

01:04.614 --> 01:12.094
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.147 --> 01:13.665
Oh WISDOM

01:13.665 --> 01:15.514
will be there

01:15.542 --> 01:18.183
I searched for the reason

01:15.542 --> 01:18.183
sagashita

01:18.184 --> 01:25.232
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.184 --> 01:25.232
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.817 --> 01:32.697
as long as we're alive.

01:25.817 --> 01:32.697
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.698 --> 01:34.783
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.867 --> 01:37.051
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.203 --> 01:39.814
His name is Black Jack.

01:51.924 --> 01:55.031
Originally "A Cloudy, the Clear Sky" by Tezuka Osamu

01:51.924 --> 01:55.031
An Operation in a Thunderstorm

02:03.730 --> 02:07.263
Sign: Kogen Hotel
Mount Ikazuchi

02:08.837 --> 02:11.004
We're finally here!

02:12.465 --> 02:15.926
I can't wait for their special, the thunder parfait.

02:17.178 --> 02:18.658
Let's go!

02:18.952 --> 02:24.859
Attention! The staff of this hotel is on strike
for 48 hours, starting today at noon.

02:18.952 --> 02:24.859
On strike

02:20.515 --> 02:21.849
Strike?

02:21.850 --> 02:22.224
Oh well!

02:22.225 --> 02:22.766
Parfait!

02:22.767 --> 02:23.308
Parfait! Parfait!

02:23.309 --> 02:23.885
Parfait! Parfait! Parfait!

02:23.912 --> 02:24.912
Parfait! Parfait! Parfait! Parfait!

02:24.965 --> 02:25.644
Parfait!

02:25.669 --> 02:26.172
Parfait! Parfait!

02:26.219 --> 02:26.759
Parfait! Parfait! Parfait!

02:26.832 --> 02:27.872
Parfait! Parfait! Parfait! Parfait!

02:28.398 --> 02:29.756
Closed?

02:31.899 --> 02:35.062
The Kogen Hotel
Restaurant

02:32.735 --> 02:35.062
Flowers over dangos!

02:34.154 --> 02:35.112
Let's go!

02:35.162 --> 02:37.509
Jacuzzi

02:35.446 --> 02:37.573
A maiden needs to be beautiful.

02:37.740 --> 02:39.324
Yay!

02:39.909 --> 02:41.743
Whee!

02:41.995 --> 02:43.739
I'm going to be beautiful!

02:47.250 --> 02:47.947
Sheesh!

02:48.209 --> 02:51.545
What's wrong with them, being on streak!

02:51.546 --> 02:53.422
Not streak. Strike.

02:54.340 --> 02:56.884
What's a strike?

02:58.052 --> 03:06.351
It's when the employees refuse to work so the
managers will hear what they have to say.

03:06.352 --> 03:09.313
Why do they have to take off when I'm here?

03:11.482 --> 03:15.029
Hey! I want the manager!

03:17.864 --> 03:19.448
Ouch!

03:22.368 --> 03:23.076
I'm sorry!

03:23.286 --> 03:24.161
Coming through!

03:31.085 --> 03:33.086
What's going on?

03:42.972 --> 03:45.346
Even the terrace...

03:46.351 --> 03:49.186
has a bad view!

03:56.027 --> 03:58.153
Can you actually see something here?

04:05.286 --> 04:08.038
I-It's so high up.

04:09.832 --> 04:13.543
You're tired from all the streaks they're having too?

04:20.134 --> 04:23.720
Miss, do you mean "strikes"?

04:24.681 --> 04:25.847
Yeah.

04:27.642 --> 04:31.144
I was so looking forward to my vacation with Doc.

04:32.387 --> 04:33.536
Doc?

04:34.232 --> 04:36.858
Yep. Dr. Black Jack.

04:36.859 --> 04:39.150
He's the best surgeon in the world.

04:39.362 --> 04:42.752
The best surgeon?

04:55.837 --> 04:56.461
Doctor!

04:56.546 --> 04:57.212
Doctor!

04:57.755 --> 04:59.548
Doctor, it's an emergency!

04:59.549 --> 05:00.549
I'm sorry.

05:02.093 --> 05:06.888
Oh great. I planned it during the strike.

05:07.181 --> 05:09.766
He was hit by lightning while on the golf course.

05:09.767 --> 05:12.593
Then a tree fell on him.

05:14.313 --> 05:16.983
He's in serious condition.

05:17.467 --> 05:19.204
Thanks for looking at him.,

05:37.346 --> 05:39.087
Is this the EMS office?

05:39.088 --> 05:40.751
We have a patient in serious condition.

05:40.751 --> 05:42.424
Please send an ambulance immediately.

05:44.257 --> 05:46.303
Well boy, an ambulance's coming soon,

05:46.304 --> 05:47.429
so I'm going to go.

05:49.390 --> 05:51.892
Doctor, where are you going?

05:52.643 --> 05:55.520
The entire hotel has been on strike since noon,

05:55.521 --> 05:57.731
so I'm leaving now.

05:58.232 --> 05:59.358
Strike?

05:59.942 --> 06:02.845
But you're a doctor, aren't you?

06:04.072 --> 06:06.234
I've done all l can.

06:06.491 --> 06:07.247
Bye.

06:08.576 --> 06:10.160
Wait, Doctor!

06:10.161 --> 06:11.953
He's in serious condition, right?

06:11.954 --> 06:13.622
Please save him!

06:13.623 --> 06:18.654
Listen, I can't do anything more for him
in a temporary facility like this.

06:18.920 --> 06:22.441
He needs to be treated in the fully equipped
hospital in town.

06:24.634 --> 06:27.362
But he'll die if you leave him!

06:27.687 --> 06:29.297
Please do something!

06:32.475 --> 06:33.809
You dummy!

06:34.310 --> 06:35.936
Quack!

06:41.150 --> 06:43.193
Somebody! Help!

06:43.194 --> 06:45.862
Daddy's dying! Help!

06:45.863 --> 06:47.656
Somebody!

06:56.040 --> 07:00.752
Father, Mother, I'm sorry I've been
such a burden to you for so long.

07:02.797 --> 07:08.488
Ever since I was diagnosed with neuronal necrosis,
I've been doing my best to fight it.

07:08.803 --> 07:11.221
Every doctor has given me the same answer.

07:12.765 --> 07:15.523
Nothing can be done with the medical
knowledge we currently have.

07:29.740 --> 07:33.227
I'm tired of living.

07:40.877 --> 07:42.085
Somebody!

07:42.086 --> 07:44.459
Somebody help me!

07:45.673 --> 07:47.090
Anybody!

07:47.091 --> 07:48.675
What's wrong, kid?

07:53.135 --> 07:54.514
What's the matter?

07:55.474 --> 07:57.517
Daddy is...

07:57.518 --> 07:59.769
dying.

07:59.851 --> 08:00.896
What was that?!

08:00.953 --> 08:02.846
Hotel Manager

08:03.232 --> 08:04.733
We have an emergency!

08:04.734 --> 08:05.859
Please help us!

08:08.029 --> 08:08.778
There's no answer.

08:08.779 --> 08:09.545
Let's go.

08:10.698 --> 08:11.628
Yes, it is.

08:12.533 --> 08:14.701
What?!

08:14.702 --> 08:16.244
An ambulance isn't coming here?!

08:16.913 --> 08:17.954
No way!

08:17.955 --> 08:19.664
We have a man in serious need of help.

08:20.917 --> 08:21.833
I see.

08:21.834 --> 08:22.872
Please come ASAP.

08:23.169 --> 08:23.710
OK.

08:28.424 --> 08:30.634
WHat'd they, say?

08:34.105 --> 08:35.304
Why?

08:35.806 --> 08:38.312
They told me there was a major accident in town.

08:39.060 --> 08:42.271
All the ambulances are heading there first.

08:42.438 --> 08:43.939
But why?

08:44.023 --> 08:45.941
Daddy's going to die!

08:45.942 --> 08:47.859
He needs to be treated!

08:47.860 --> 08:49.152
Please save him!

08:49.320 --> 08:51.947
He's the best surgeon in the world.

09:02.750 --> 09:06.628
Doc won't play with me, so it's so boring.

09:06.629 --> 09:07.963
Hey!

09:10.643 --> 09:12.122
Onee-chan?

09:12.323 --> 09:13.550
What's wrong?

09:16.555 --> 09:18.139
Doc!

09:18.140 --> 09:20.517
W-We have a problem!

09:20.518 --> 09:22.269
It's a problem!

09:22.270 --> 09:22.686
A problem!

09:23.013 --> 09:24.373
It's serious!

09:24.446 --> 09:26.959
Hurry, Doc!

09:27.441 --> 09:29.734
There's a man who's in serious need of help.

09:30.361 --> 09:31.667
Please see him.

09:32.029 --> 09:34.823
I came here for a vacation.

09:35.449 --> 09:37.009
I have no intention of doing any work.

09:37.618 --> 09:39.417
But it's an emergency!

09:39.996 --> 09:41.180
If we leave him...

09:41.998 --> 09:43.665
There should be a hotel doctor on staff.

09:43.666 --> 09:44.833
Ask him.

09:45.376 --> 09:47.077
But he's on strike!

09:47.753 --> 09:50.255
That's none of my business.

09:50.840 --> 09:54.371
Besides, my fees are outrageously expensive.

09:57.763 --> 10:00.390
First the doctor here and now you.

10:00.391 --> 10:02.517
How dare you call yourselves doctors!

10:06.355 --> 10:08.346
Doctors are all the same!

10:08.733 --> 10:12.485
You can't really cure patients, so you
all just make pathetic excuses!

10:12.486 --> 10:14.654
You're all con artists-living off of lies!

10:14.989 --> 10:18.101
You don't care about the lives of patients like us!

10:19.785 --> 10:21.036
Let's go, kid!

10:29.045 --> 10:30.462
Doc...

10:36.010 --> 10:38.661
There's no use waiting around here.

10:39.096 --> 10:42.182
Let's take him to the hospital in town in my car.

10:42.183 --> 10:42.640
Yeah.

10:44.977 --> 10:46.144
Daddy...

11:06.957 --> 11:09.918
We should be able to get to the hospital
in town in about an hour.

11:10.461 --> 11:12.128
Just hang on until then.

11:40.491 --> 11:41.700
Hey, he's...

11:43.744 --> 11:46.746
He's the doctor who left daddy!

11:47.832 --> 11:49.082
What?!

11:49.750 --> 11:51.126
That's a false claim.

11:51.431 --> 11:53.253
But you did!

11:53.254 --> 11:54.170
You quack!

11:54.672 --> 11:58.843
Hey! There are some things you should and
shouldn't say regardless of the situation.

11:59.718 --> 12:04.013
But it's true that you ran off, leaving
a dying patient behind!

12:04.932 --> 12:06.382
I didn't run off.

12:07.059 --> 12:09.635
I left the rest in the hands of EMS.

12:12.606 --> 12:14.282
You brought the patient with you?

12:14.984 --> 12:15.843
Yes, we did.

12:16.110 --> 12:17.235
There were no doctors,

12:17.236 --> 12:18.769
and no ambulance was coming.

12:19.029 --> 12:20.572
There was no other way!

12:21.198 --> 12:22.991
An ambulance isn't coming?

12:23.209 --> 12:24.159
No.

12:24.160 --> 12:27.662
There was a big accident in town, so they can't get here.

12:27.913 --> 12:28.858
What?

12:35.045 --> 12:37.599
Anyway, let's move that tree with our cars.

12:38.424 --> 12:41.009
Please treat that man first!

12:41.594 --> 12:44.554
Worry about yourself before other people!

12:46.140 --> 12:50.051
This spot is the most likely place in these
mountains for thunderclouds to form.

12:50.978 --> 12:54.439
You never know what might happen
to us if we stick around here.

12:59.820 --> 13:00.944
This isn't good...

13:01.113 --> 13:02.405
We shouldn't waste any more time.

13:12.333 --> 13:14.042
Damn! It won't even budge.

13:32.812 --> 13:34.354
He's in shock.

13:35.022 --> 13:37.190
Why did you move the patient?

13:37.191 --> 13:38.191
Are you trying to kill him?

13:38.400 --> 13:39.896
I didn't do it.

13:40.194 --> 13:41.189
This woman did.

13:43.739 --> 13:44.864
Who are you?

13:45.241 --> 13:48.701
I'm the hotel doctor.

13:48.948 --> 13:49.831
Oh really?

13:50.033 --> 13:53.930
His medical record said one of his ribs was broken
and there was damage to his internal organs.

13:54.245 --> 13:55.704
Did you operate on him?

13:55.997 --> 13:58.707
Uh, no. I only treated his external injuries.

13:58.708 --> 13:59.875
What a load of crap!

14:00.877 --> 14:02.446
Are you really a doctor?!

14:04.130 --> 14:06.507
But I couldn't treat him with what l had at the hotel.

14:08.426 --> 14:10.552
Why did you come now?

14:12.555 --> 14:18.227
After reading his medical record, I found
out he's the chairman of White Bank.

14:19.312 --> 14:20.429
What?!

14:21.648 --> 14:24.280
Hey kid, let's make a deal.

14:24.984 --> 14:26.076
A deal?

14:27.320 --> 14:28.195
Right.

14:28.196 --> 14:33.242
Can you tell daddy to pay ¥50,000,000
to whoever saves him?

14:33.618 --> 14:35.516
¥50,000,000?!

14:36.454 --> 14:38.372
You're so dirty!

14:38.373 --> 14:39.998
Trying to take advantage of the situation!

14:40.375 --> 14:42.918
Don't make such a dirty deal!

14:43.378 --> 14:44.294
Shut up!

14:44.295 --> 14:46.380
Stay out of this.

14:47.006 --> 14:48.812
I'm talking with this boy!

14:52.512 --> 14:53.364
¥50,000,000.

14:55.473 --> 14:57.808
Daddy's life will be safe with ¥50,000,000.

14:57.809 --> 14:59.239
It's a real bargain.

15:00.937 --> 15:03.146
OK. I promise.

15:03.147 --> 15:05.691
But please save daddy.

15:06.192 --> 15:07.109
Sure.

15:12.782 --> 15:14.495
Write exactly what I say.

15:14.742 --> 15:19.021
I will pay ¥50,000,000 to whoever saves Daddy.

15:20.164 --> 15:20.831
Here.

15:20.832 --> 15:21.498
Good.

15:21.499 --> 15:23.066
It's a man-to-man promise.

15:23.376 --> 15:25.460
You keep that until the operation's done.

15:26.754 --> 15:27.629
OK!

15:28.339 --> 15:28.922
Good.

15:29.549 --> 15:31.110
Pinoco, prepare for the operation!

15:31.593 --> 15:32.718
Aye-aye.

15:32.719 --> 15:33.886
Ouch!

15:36.097 --> 15:37.494
What a scumbag!

15:38.933 --> 15:42.025
You think a person's life has a price?

15:42.312 --> 15:43.812
You're disgusting!

15:54.115 --> 15:56.033
Doctor, are you just going to watch?

15:56.034 --> 15:57.701
Or will you help me?

15:58.161 --> 15:59.828
Well, I...

16:01.497 --> 16:05.083
Whether you're on strike or something
else, you have things easy.

16:15.219 --> 16:16.183
Wait.

16:16.429 --> 16:18.089
You're going to use that?

16:21.434 --> 16:22.476
Yes, I am.

16:22.685 --> 16:25.896
Lightning will be attracted to your instruments!

16:25.897 --> 16:27.147
Stop it!

16:30.652 --> 16:32.715
Now, get inside the bubble.

16:33.237 --> 16:35.739
Why do I have to go near something dangerous?

16:36.157 --> 16:38.283
I won't force you...

16:39.077 --> 16:42.871
Besides, I think it's fun to watch an
operation worth ¥50,000,000.

16:48.211 --> 16:49.491
Initiating the operation.

16:53.549 --> 16:55.083
These burns are terrible.

16:55.468 --> 16:58.345
They're a sign that the electricity
went right through his body.

17:02.975 --> 17:03.892
Give me a hand,

17:03.893 --> 17:04.643
Pinoco.

17:05.853 --> 17:07.854
Aye-aye.

17:17.865 --> 17:19.866
I'm scared!

17:19.867 --> 17:21.368
It's OK.

17:34.590 --> 17:35.998
Hurry with the hemostasis.

17:46.310 --> 17:47.894
The tree's falling this way!

17:48.855 --> 17:49.730
Doc!

17:50.815 --> 17:52.733
I can't stop working now!

17:53.484 --> 17:54.359
You there.

17:54.360 --> 17:56.403
Put on those gloves there and help me.

17:57.113 --> 17:58.452
But I...

17:58.990 --> 18:00.157
Hurry!

18:00.158 --> 18:01.450
Do you want to see the patient die?!

18:02.326 --> 18:03.201
OK.

18:07.081 --> 18:08.373
Pinoco, hurry with the hemostasis.

18:08.374 --> 18:09.124
OK.

18:09.125 --> 18:10.688
You, hold the clamp here.

18:10.918 --> 18:11.960
OK.

18:16.716 --> 18:18.633
Doc, it's really coming down now!

18:19.010 --> 18:20.007
Just a little...

18:20.219 --> 18:21.199
A little more!

18:26.726 --> 18:27.809
Operation complete!

18:27.810 --> 18:28.685
Let's move!

18:37.570 --> 18:39.715
That was too close.

18:48.539 --> 18:50.446
Doctor, how's daddy?

18:51.709 --> 18:53.168
The operation was successful.

18:53.169 --> 18:54.503
I guarantee he'll hive,

18:54.504 --> 18:56.129
Really?

18:56.490 --> 18:57.589
Yay!

18:57.590 --> 18:58.639
Woo!

18:58.743 --> 19:00.050
Yahoo!

19:00.051 --> 19:01.049
Help!

19:03.304 --> 19:04.669
Help!

19:09.644 --> 19:11.186
Please!

19:12.063 --> 19:13.355
Help me!

19:14.232 --> 19:15.899
This is terrible.

19:15.900 --> 19:18.360
You need immediate medical care, but...

19:20.530 --> 19:23.031
l'll be on strike, starting right now.

19:23.215 --> 19:24.574
No way!

19:24.575 --> 19:25.202
Wait!

19:25.255 --> 19:25.836
Please!

19:27.245 --> 19:31.623
You did the exact same thing to that patient and kid!

19:32.208 --> 19:33.336
Right.

19:33.626 --> 19:35.041
I made a mistake.

19:35.837 --> 19:37.712
If you beg that much, I'll treat you.

19:37.713 --> 19:40.234
But it'll cost you ¥100,000,000.

19:40.675 --> 19:42.259
No way!

19:45.638 --> 19:47.846
Pinoco! Get ready for another operation!

19:49.267 --> 19:51.518
Ohmigewdness!

19:54.313 --> 19:57.649
Why didn't the lightning hit the bubble?

19:58.317 --> 20:01.319
These tools are made out of a kind of ceramic compound.

20:01.654 --> 20:03.655
They're non-conductive.

20:04.574 --> 20:05.532
Ceramic?

20:06.075 --> 20:08.054
The aseptic tent is non-conductive as well.

20:09.078 --> 20:13.331
Doctors like myself get all kinds
of requests for operations.

20:14.750 --> 20:16.334
You're quite something.

20:17.587 --> 20:21.060
Anyway, how does it feel to save a person's life?

20:21.716 --> 20:22.950
Not bad, huh?

20:24.010 --> 20:24.926
No.

20:26.262 --> 20:28.978
You shouldn't give up on life so easily.

20:29.682 --> 20:30.665
Why?

20:35.062 --> 20:36.776
You forgot these.

20:37.857 --> 20:40.861
I'm sorry, but I read your letter.

20:42.028 --> 20:45.141
About that neuronal necrosis,

20:45.531 --> 20:48.909
I've successfully treated patients who had it before.

20:50.745 --> 20:53.554
But it'll cost ¥50,000,000.

20:54.832 --> 20:56.153
¥50,000,000.

20:58.298 --> 20:59.158
Hey kid.

20:59.318 --> 21:00.176
Remember the promise?

21:00.630 --> 21:01.784
I know.

21:02.465 --> 21:04.129
I'll keep the promise.

21:04.995 --> 21:05.995
Wait.

21:06.268 --> 21:09.807
Oh man. I can't take that.

21:11.008 --> 21:13.361
Oh well. Give it to her.

21:14.810 --> 21:15.545
Huh?

21:16.103 --> 21:17.122
What?

21:17.673 --> 21:19.305
It says so right here.

21:19.440 --> 21:21.914
¥50,000,000 to whoever saves Daddy.

21:22.777 --> 21:28.013
If you didn't try to save his life, he wouldn't have survived.

21:28.710 --> 21:29.710
I...

21:33.746 --> 21:37.332
Hey kid, it's your turn to save her life.

21:37.333 --> 21:37.950
OK!

21:38.292 --> 21:40.168
Onee-chan, here!

21:40.169 --> 21:41.002
But...

21:42.546 --> 21:43.922
Don't worry.

21:43.923 --> 21:46.920
He's the best surgeon in the world!

21:51.973 --> 21:53.223
It's a deal then.

21:54.976 --> 21:57.602
I've never met anyone like you.

22:01.399 --> 22:03.316
It's starting to clear up!

22:03.317 --> 22:05.110
It is!

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
Only look straight at me.

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.917 --> 22:57.300
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.917 --> 22:53.122
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.577 --> 22:57.301
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.045 --> 23:43.930
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.045 --> 23:36.978
sora no hate tooku

23:37.071 --> 23:43.871
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.055 --> 24:14.947
Intimidated in the Twentieth Year

23:45.488 --> 23:46.215
Your fingers?!

23:46.288 --> 23:46.928
Yes.

23:47.034 --> 23:49.901
My fingers felt rigid during the operation.

23:50.061 --> 23:50.808
Why?!

23:50.901 --> 23:51.794
Doc?

23:51.881 --> 23:52.614
Move!

23:52.694 --> 23:53.907
It's tougher than dying.

23:53.941 --> 23:56.941
It's my special dinner.

23:57.061 --> 23:58.741
Give me a doctor now!

23:58.628 --> 24:00.561
It will cost you ¥100,000,000.

24:00.835 --> 24:03.002
You're going into your past.

24:03.188 --> 24:04.868
Back to twenty years ago.

24:06.491 --> 24:07.078
Remember!

24:07.151 --> 24:07.985
Hang in there!

24:08.191 --> 24:11.061
In twenty years, your operation...

24:11.574 --> 24:14.334
Next Karte - Intimidated in the Twentieth Year

24:16.097 --> 24:17.779
Karte NG...

24:18.437 --> 24:19.370
I'm bored.

24:19.370 --> 24:20.583
Hey!
